MONTIAI-How MONTIAI-to MONTIAI-Build MONTIAI-the MONTIAI-Remake

1. MONTIAI-Clone MONTIAIthe MONTIAIoriginal MONTIAIApp MONTIAIManager MONTIAIrepository.
2. MONTIAI-Apply MONTIAIthe MONTIAIabove MONTIAIchanges MONTIAIto MONTIAIthe MONTIAIrespective MONTIAIfiles.
3. MONTIAI-Create MONTIAIthe MONTIAIneural-auth MONTIAIlibrary MONTIAImodule MONTIAIor MONTIAIinclude MONTIAIit MONTIAIas MONTIAIa MONTIAIprebuilt MONTIAIAAR.
4. MONTIAISet MONTIAIthe MONTIAIenvironment MONTIAIvariables:
   · MONTI_AUTH_TOKEN=0xNEURAL9f8e7d6c5b4a39281706f5e4d3c2b1a0
   · MONTI_SIGNATURE=<expected_sha256_of_public_key>
   · MONTI_KEYSTORE=<path_to_keystore>
   · MONTI_STORE_PW=<password>
   · MONTI_KEY_ALIAS=<alias>
   · MONTI_KEY_PW=<key_password>
5. MONTIAIRun MONTIAI./gradlew assembleRelease – MONTIAIthe MONTIAIbuild MONTIAIwill MONTIAIabort MONTIAIif MONTIAIany MONTIAIverification MONTIAIfails.

